## Why This Is Asked

Tests for live schema migrations and canary rollouts are critical in scalable services. This question probes practical techniques for migration tests, compatibility guarantees, and safe rollback.

## Key Concepts

- In-place schema migrations, backward/forward compatibility, feature flag gating, canary deployment, cross-region data consistency, rollback strategies

## Code Example

```javascript
// Migration test scaffold (pseudo)
async function testMigration(seed, migrate, verify){
  await seed(0);
  await migrate(1);
  await verify(1);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you simulate partial migration across regions and measure impact?
- What metrics trigger rollback and what tooling helps ensure rollback correctness?

